{"id": "DerldXdPE38", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"MOTION\" to get this Free AI Motion Graphic Prompt library. \n\nClaude can now build full professional motion graphics from scratch.\n\nAnd someone just put together a whole library showing exactly how to create the best ones.\n\nThe library is called Prompt Motion.\n\nIt has over 500 animated videos made with Claude.\n\nAnd each one comes with the exact prompt used to create it.\n\nThink of it like a recipe book for motion graphics.\n\nInside, you get prompts for launch videos, product demos, and mobile app walkthroughs.\n\nYou'll also find prompts for charts, and much more.\n\nNormally you'd have to figure out every animation yourself.\n\nHere you can see the finished video first.\n\nThen you grab the prompt behind it.\n\nYou just copy the one you like.\n\nThen tweak it for your brand or product.\n\nAnd Claude will recreate it in that exact style.\n\nWith the same animations and sound effects.\n\nSo you're never starting from a blank page.\n\nYou're starting from something that already works.\n\nSo the hardest part is already done for you.\n\nThat's the whole idea behind this library.\n\n#claudecode #aiprompting #Promptlibrary #aimotiongraphics #claudemotion", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792423952, "like_count": 2261, "comment_count": 3790, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-914893818221841a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.218, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPyW86Sddy2nMblIoQXZ2tVBvI259H6k8ES-OqJihypfeYCtkj5pBkvJZsOjVBupDgqLcdJA00dNKv4VOEi0fKSSyjrliHAaR6Twks.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdruDdQqSNUggcQv6eW8e9bK1-v5U1fB8Tmzl2Y8x-8H_UYXgnpiVtCPOrO4MItpZuM&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=hTi3Mok09_4Q7kNvwHj